#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:2
msgid "lmcache trace"
msgstr "lmcache trace"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:4
msgid ""
"The ``lmcache trace`` command inspects and replays LMCache trace files "
"(``.lct``). A file holds one trace *level*: ``storage`` records "
"``StorageManager`` calls; ``events`` records the cache-event stream a "
"server emits for the MP coordinator. It has three sub-commands:"
msgstr "``lmcache trace`` 命令检查并重放 LMCache 追踪文件 (``.lct``)。一个文件包含一个追踪 *级别*：``storage`` 记录 ``StorageManager`` 调用；``events`` 记录服务器为 MP 协调器发出的缓存事件流。它有三个子命令："

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:15
msgid ""
"``lmcache trace`` needs the full ``lmcache`` package (StorageManager, "
"trace codecs, ``TraceReader``). It is not available in the lightweight "
"``lmcache-cli`` install and exits with status ``2`` if those modules are "
"missing."
msgstr ""
"``lmcache trace`` 需要完整的 ``lmcache`` 包（StorageManager、trace 编解码器、\\ "
"``TraceReader``\\ ）。在轻量级的 ``lmcache-cli`` 安装中不可用，如果缺少这些模块，则会以状态 ``2`` 退出。"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:20
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Trace *capture* is not a ``trace`` sub-command — recording is bound to a "
"live server via ``lmcache server --trace-level {storage,events} [--trace-"
"output ...]`` (see :doc:`server`)."
msgstr "跟踪 *捕获* 不是 ``trace`` 子命令 — 记录绑定到通过 ``lmcache server --trace-level {storage,events} [--trace-output ...]`` 的实时服务器（见 :doc:`server`）。"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:26
msgid "info"
msgstr "信息"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:28
msgid ""
"Print a one-screen summary of a trace file: header metadata plus per-"
"qualname record counts. Works for both levels."
msgstr "打印跟踪文件的一屏摘要：头部元数据加上每个 qualname 的记录计数。适用于两个级别。"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:35
msgid "A ``storage`` file:"
msgstr "一个 ``storage`` 文件："

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:50
msgid ""
"An ``events`` file adds the header metadata the level records and a "
"summary of the stream: which server wrote it and how many times it "
"restarted (one incarnation per start), batches by event type, tier, "
"backend and whether the backend is shared, entries per event type, bytes "
"stored, and how many store entries carry token ids."
msgstr "一个 ``events`` 文件添加了头部元数据，包括级别记录和流的摘要：哪个服务器写入了它，以及它重启了多少次（每次启动一个实例），按事件类型、层级、后端以及后端是否共享进行批处理，每种事件类型的条目、存储的字节数，以及有多少存储条目携带令牌 ID。"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:88
msgid ""
"``lifecycle: start=1, stop=1`` says the server started once and shut down"
" cleanly; a missing ``stop`` means the process was killed and the tail "
"may be truncated. ``restarts`` counts incarnations beyond the first."
msgstr "``lifecycle: start=1, stop=1`` 表示服务器启动了一次并且正常关闭；缺少 ``stop`` 表示进程被终止，尾部可能被截断。 ``restarts`` 计算超过第一次的实例。"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:92
msgid ""
"The only argument is the positional ``FILE`` (path to a ``.lct`` trace "
"file)."
msgstr "唯一的参数是位置参数 ``FILE``\\ （指向 ``.lct`` 跟踪文件的路径）。"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:96
msgid "replay"
msgstr "重放"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:98
msgid ""
"Reissue every recorded call against a fresh ``StorageManager``, honoring "
"the recorded inter-call timings. ``replay`` accepts ``storage`` files "
"only; an ``events`` file is refused with a message saying so, since its "
"records are coordinator input rather than storage calls (see ``replay-"
"events``)."
msgstr "对每个记录的调用进行重发，使用一个新的 ``StorageManager``，并遵循记录的调用间隔时间。``replay`` 仅接受 ``storage`` 文件；``events`` 文件会被拒绝，并显示相应的消息，因为其记录是协调器输入而不是存储调用（请参见 ``replay-events``）。"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:108
msgid ""
"``replay`` accepts the standard storage-manager configuration flags "
"(``--l1-size-gb``, ``--eviction-policy``, ``--l2-...``); see ``lmcache "
"server --help`` for the full list. The replay-side config may differ from"
" the config recorded in the trace, which can legitimately cause retrieve "
"misses."
msgstr ""
"``replay`` 接受标准的存储管理器配置标志（\\ ``--l1-size-gb``, ``--eviction-policy``, "
"``--l2-...``\\ ）；有关完整列表，请参见 ``lmcache server --help``\\ "
"。重放侧的配置可能与记录在追踪中的配置不同，这可能会导致合法的查找未命中。"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:116
msgid ""
"A replay environment mismatch may cause retrieve misses. Replay uses the "
"replay-side StorageManager config (which may differ from the recorded "
"config), runs on a host whose performance may differ from the recording "
"host, and StorageManager reads/writes are async. Treat retrieve-miss "
"counts as a signal about the replay environment, not a defect in the "
"trace."
msgstr ""
"重放环境不匹配可能导致查找未命中。重放使用重放端的 StorageManager "
"配置（可能与记录的配置不同），在性能可能与记录主机不同的主机上运行，并且 StorageManager "
"的读/写是异步的。将查找未命中计数视为重放环境的信号，而不是记录中的缺陷。"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:123 ../../source/cli/trace.rst:187
msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:129 ../../source/cli/trace.rst:193
msgid "Flag"
msgstr "标志"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:130 ../../source/cli/trace.rst:194
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:131 ../../source/cli/trace.rst:195
msgid "``FILE``"
msgstr "``FILE``"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:132
msgid "Path to a ``.lct`` trace file (positional, required)."
msgstr "```.lct``` 跟踪文件的路径（位置参数，必填）。"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:133
msgid "``--verbose``"
msgstr "``--verbose``"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:134
msgid "Print one line per replayed record."
msgstr "每个重放记录打印一行。"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:135
msgid "``--jsonl-out PATH``"
msgstr "``--jsonl-out PATH``"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:136
msgid ""
"Write one JSON object per replayed record to ``PATH`` (qualname, "
"latency_ms, failed)."
msgstr "将每个重放记录写入一个 JSON 对象到 ``PATH``\\ （qualname，延迟_ms，失败）。"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:138
msgid "``--output-dir DIR``"
msgstr "``--output-dir DIR``"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:139
msgid ""
"Directory for aggregated CSV / JSON summary output (default: current "
"directory)."
msgstr "聚合的 CSV / JSON 摘要输出目录（默认：当前目录）。"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:141
msgid "``--no-csv``"
msgstr "``--no-csv``"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:142
msgid "Skip the aggregated CSV summary export."
msgstr "跳过聚合的 CSV 摘要导出。"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:143
msgid "``--json``"
msgstr "``--json``"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:144
msgid "Also export an aggregated JSON summary."
msgstr "还可以导出一个汇总的 JSON。"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:145 ../../source/cli/trace.rst:205
msgid "``-q`` / ``--quiet``"
msgstr "``-q`` / ``--quiet``"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:146
msgid "Suppress the terminal metrics table (files are still written)."
msgstr "抑制终端指标表（文件仍然会被写入）。"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:148
msgid ""
"The terminal summary reports overall replay stats (records replayed / "
"skipped / failed, duration, config-digest match) and per-op latency "
"percentiles. ``replay`` exits with status ``1`` if any record failed."
msgstr ""
"终端摘要报告整体重放统计信息（重放/跳过/失败的记录、持续时间、配置摘要匹配）和每个操作的延迟百分位数。如果任何记录失败，\\ "
"``replay`` 将以状态 ``1`` 退出。"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:154
msgid "replay-events"
msgstr "重放事件"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:156
msgid ""
"Deliver the cache-event stream an ``events`` file holds to a coordinator,"
" the way the server that wrote it would have. Several files, one per "
"server, replay as one fleet, merged by wall-clock time:"
msgstr "将缓存事件流中 ``events`` 文件所包含的内容传递给协调器，方式与写入该文件的服务器相同。多个文件，每个服务器一个，按墙钟时间合并为一个队列重放："

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:165
msgid ""
"Each ``start`` mark registers its server with the coordinator (at the "
"address the server recorded, or loopback) and begins heartbeating it "
"every ``--heartbeat-interval`` seconds, each batch is one ``POST "
"/events`` carrying the record unchanged, and each ``stop`` mark "
"deregisters. A file that ends without a ``stop`` is a server that died or"
" a recording that was cut: its heartbeats end with its last record, and "
"the coordinator retires it after its instance timeout, as it would a real"
" crash. By default the stream goes as fast as the coordinator takes it; "
"``--speed 1`` replays at the recorded rate. The servers are not there to "
"be called back, so a replay exercises ingest and the views (directory, "
"usage, declared capacity), not a controller's deletes or prefetches; run "
"the coordinator with its eviction loop off to keep it from addressing "
"them. The summary says how the coordinator counted the batches: applied, "
"duplicate (a sequence it had already admitted) and stale (an incarnation "
"it had already moved past)."
msgstr "每个 ``start`` 标记将其服务器注册到协调器（在服务器记录的地址或回环地址），并开始每 ``--heartbeat-interval`` 秒向其发送心跳，每个批次是一个 ``POST /events``，携带未更改的记录，每个 ``stop`` 标记则注销。一个没有 ``stop`` 结束的文件表示一个已死的服务器或被中断的录音：其心跳在最后一条记录结束，协调器在实例超时后将其退役，就像处理真正的崩溃一样。默认情况下，流的速度与协调器处理的速度相同；``--speed 1`` 以记录的速率重放。服务器并不在这里等待被调用，因此重放会测试摄取和视图（目录、使用情况、声明的容量），而不是控制器的删除或预取；运行协调器时关闭其逐出循环，以防止其处理这些操作。摘要说明了协调器如何计算批次：应用的、重复的（它已经接受的序列）和过时的（它已经处理过的实例）。"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:182
msgid ""
"Replay into a coordinator that does not have the same fleet live. "
"Registering a recorded server replaces a live one's registration, and the"
" coordinator would address the live server at the recorded address."
msgstr "将重放到没有相同舰队在线的协调器中。注册一个记录的服务器会替换一个在线服务器的注册，协调器会在记录的地址上处理在线服务器。"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:196
msgid "One or more ``events``-level ``.lct`` files (positional, required)."
msgstr "一个或多个 ``events`` 级别的 ``.lct`` 文件（位置参数，必需）。"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:197
msgid "``--coordinator-url URL``"
msgstr "``--coordinator-url URL``"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:198
msgid "The coordinator to deliver the stream to (required)."
msgstr "将流传送到的协调器（必填）。"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:199
msgid "``--speed N``"
msgstr "``--speed N``"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:200
msgid ""
"Pacing relative to the recording; ``1`` is the recorded rate, ``0`` "
"(default) as fast as the coordinator takes it."
msgstr "与录制的速度相关；``1`` 是录制的速率，``0``（默认值）是协调器能处理的最快速率。"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:202
msgid "``--heartbeat-interval SECONDS``"
msgstr "``--heartbeat-interval SECONDS``"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:203
msgid ""
"Heartbeat each registered server this often (default ``5``, below the "
"coordinator's 30 s instance timeout); ``0`` sends none."
msgstr "每个注册的服务器的心跳频率（默认 ``5``，低于协调器的 30 秒实例超时）；``0`` 表示不发送心跳。"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:206
msgid "Suppress the terminal summary."
msgstr "抑制终端摘要。"

#: ../../source/cli/trace.rst:208
msgid ""
"``replay-events`` exits with status ``2`` if a file is not an ``events`` "
"trace this build can replay, and with status ``1`` if the coordinator "
"cannot be reached or refuses a call; the replay stops there rather than "
"skip records, since a partly delivered stream would leave views that look"
" complete and are not. The per-record log says how far it got."
msgstr "``replay-events`` 在文件不是此构建可以重放的 ``events`` 跟踪时以状态 ``2`` 退出，如果协调器无法访问或拒绝调用则以状态 ``1`` 退出；重放在此停止，而不是跳过记录，因为部分交付的流会留下看似完整但实际上并不完整的视图。每条记录的日志会说明它进展到哪里。"

